<[jack woehr] JAX> 19200 clock. doubly nested 1 million DO LOOP in 13.75 
<[jack woehr] JAX> seconds/24 for 8088
<[jack woehr] JAX> .
<[jack woehr] JAX> people keep asking if its the Z8 ...
<[jack woehr] JAX> kind of but almost 200 more registers than the Z8, higher 
<[jack woehr] JAX> clock ,. ..
<[jack woehr] JAX> and it has those three beutiful machine instructions:
<[jack woehr] JAX> ENTER EXIT NEXT
