<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> ga
<[jack woehr] JAX>
<[jack woehr] JAX> ENTER in pseudocode:
<[Gary] GARY-S> HOLLA !
<[jack woehr] JAX> sp <- sp-2  ( that's the system stack, the forth return 
<[jack woehr] JAX> stack, unlike 8088
<[jack woehr] JAX> @sp <- ip ip <- pc pc <- @ip ip <- ip + 2
<[jack woehr] JAX> got that?
<[jack woehr] JAX> ga
<[jack woehr] JAX> hey gar
<[Gary] GARY-S> WOT IS JACKL
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> hi gary, let me study that jack
<[jack woehr] JAX> anyway, ENTER starts a colon def, EXIT ends one, NEXT ends a 
<[jack woehr] JAX> code def
