<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> EXIT would be UNNEST...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> and NEXT is the same, at least for F83
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> ga
<[jack woehr] JAX> pretty much so
<[jack woehr] JAX> except
<[jack woehr] JAX> ENTER EXIT NEXT are machine instructions here.
<[jack woehr] JAX> so very fast by comparison
<[jack woehr] JAX> with standard f83
<[jack woehr] JAX> although ...
